## Model Identity and Background

**Developer:** OpenAI
**Release Date:** April 23, 2026 (ChatGPT), April 24, 2026 (API)
**Series:** GPT-5.5 (GPT-5.5, GPT-5.5 Pro)
**Predecessor:** GPT-5.4 Pro (March 2026)
**Successor:** GPT-5.6 Sol (June 2026)
**License:** Proprietary
**Context Window:** 1,050,000 tokens
**Max Output:** 128,000 tokens

GPT-5.5 Pro is OpenAI's high-capability model optimized for deep reasoning and accuracy on complex, high-stakes workloads. It was released alongside GPT-5.5 on April 23, 2026, with API access following on April 24, 2026. The model is designed for long-horizon problem solving, agentic coding, and precise execution across multi-step workflows. GPT-5.5 Pro is positioned as the "maximum capability" variant in the GPT-5.5 family, offering higher accuracy for research-grade tasks. The model is available to Pro, Business, and Enterprise users in ChatGPT, with API access for all paid tiers.

