## Independent Benchmarks and Reviews

### BrowseComp Benchmark
**Source:** Vellum.ai
**Snapshot:** April 2026

- BrowseComp: 90.1% (verified, highest among GPT-5.5 family)
- GPT-5.5: 84.4% (verified)
- Claude Opus 4.7: 79.3% (verified)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro: 85.9% (verified)

GPT-5.5 Pro leads the GPT-5.5 family on BrowseComp, a benchmark that tests the model's ability to browse and analyze web content. This demonstrates strong multi-tool orchestration capabilities.

### Terminal Benchmarks
**Source:** Vellum.ai
**Snapshot:** April 2026

- Terminal-Bench 2.0: 82.7% (verified, comparable to GPT-5.5)
- GPT-5.5: 82.7% (verified)
- Claude Opus 4.7: 69.4% (verified)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro: 68.5% (verified)

GPT-5.5 Pro achieves the same score as GPT-5.5 on Terminal-Bench 2.0, demonstrating strong agentic coding capabilities.

