**Source:** OpenAI API documentation
**Snapshot:** 2026

Standard pricing:
- Input: $30.00 per 1M tokens
- Output: $180.00 per 1M tokens
- Cache read: $0.20 per 1M tokens
- Cache write: 90% discount on input
- Batch API: 50% discount on input and output
- Priority processing: 2.5x the standard rate

Pricing comparison:
- GPT-5.5 Pro: $30/$180 (6x more expensive than GPT-5.5)
- GPT-5.5: $5/$30
- GPT-5.6 Sol: $2/$10 (15x cheaper)
- GPT-5.6 Terra: $2.40/$12 (12.5x cheaper)
